{"authored" [{"question" "q-11568" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $ST$,  if  $S=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]$ and $T=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}].$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974340/state.json" "file_sha256" "e88b9d7950c3b7315955639dad412b561335e47da1926578f4da365795c6c21e" "basis" 763 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974340/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-11568" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Multiplying each row in the first matrix by each column in the second, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}ST & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3+0+8 & 2+0-4 & 3+0+4 \\\\ 0-5+4 & 0+5-2 & 0-0+2 \\\\ 6+0+4 & 4-0-2 & 6+0+2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}11 & -2 & 7 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 10 & 2 & 8\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974340/state.json" "file_sha256" "e88b9d7950c3b7315955639dad412b561335e47da1926578f4da365795c6c21e" "basis" 763 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974340/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-11568" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974340/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "898522b5bb4b1b5a0a4ec444f79f34954a5e67d8d74d4892a1066c25331c1cec" "basis" 763 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974340/edb-import/verification.json"} {"que